<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Even though we love the Lord so much,</l><l>Somehow, it seems we get out of touch</l><l>With Jesus. How can we be freed from such</l><l>distress?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Sometimes we know we aren’t being real</l><l>Then times, we just live by how we feel.</l><l>Is there some way we could ever deal</l><l>with self?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Christians, scattered throughout all the earth</l><l>Are wand’ring—Lord, where is Your Bride of worth?</l><l>How can all those of the second birth</l><l>be one?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
